  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This week I uploaded a few worlds in order to test them, and recently I found out that as soon as the Master leaves, none of the buttons or triggers can be interacted with, although you can still pick up props and use the chairs. I also noticed that you cannot drop any portals if you encounter this issue, and last time I was left in my recent world with another person after the Master left our instance, my friend got frozen for me, although they said they could still hear me, even though I didn't hear them. As far as I know, I wasn't the first to experience it, and I'm sure this bug may need extra attention.",
